00:25:30.810 --> 00:25:49.330
<v Judith Kelling>And he took the shovel, and he started digging. And he came back. He got the blanket, and he told me-- he took me-- he made me get out the truck. I didn't want to. I told him, just take me back. He kept calling me a bitch. He goes, don't turn around, bitch. And I was getting panicky and scared because I thought he was going to try something with me.
