00:26:35.650 --> 00:26:49.910
<v Ira Glass>And so in your podcast, after you explain all that background, then your series really gets going, and you really get into the meat of it. And we follow the defense attorneys, led by Greg Wiercioch, as they try all kinds of different tactics and meet with all sorts of people to try to stop David Wood's execution.
<v Ira Glass>所以在你的播客中，在你解释了所有背景之后，你的系列节目真正开始了，你真正进入了核心内容。我们跟随以格雷格·维尔奇奥奇为首的辩护律师，因为他们尝试了各种不同的策略，并与各种各样的人会面，试图阻止大卫·伍德的处决。

00:26:49.910 --> 00:27:06.610
<v Ira Glass>They have just 12 weeks. They go to a district attorney. They go to a TV news person. They hear about somebody who thinks their dad may have committed at least some of the six murders, and they have to decide if that is worth running down. I have to say, I was really surprised at how many different roads they could go down and had to choose between.
