00:27:06.610 --> 00:27:27.530
<v Maurice Chammah>Yeah, he had a lot of them to choose between. Greg actually got the original list of police suspects, and there were 36 of them on it. And some of them did seem promising. So there was one man who failed a polygraph test about the murders, which I know those are unreliable, but he did fail it. So Greg's team runs that one down, and Alvin and I had to actually knock on some of these people's doors, too, which we describe in the show.
<v Maurice Chammah>是的，他有很多选择。格雷格实际上拿到了最初的警方嫌疑人名单，上面有36个人。其中一些确实看起来有希望。有一个人没能通过关于谋杀案的测谎仪测试，我知道那些是不可靠的，但他确实没通过。所以格雷格的团队追查了那一条，阿尔文和我也确实不得不敲开其中一些人的门，我们在节目中描述过。

00:27:27.530 --> 00:27:42.610
