<v Maurice Chammah>基本上，格雷格对这个案子的理论是警察有隧道视野。他们承受着解决此案的所有压力。受害者的家属在公开场合示威。所以他们拿走了每一份证据，对其进行润色以符合大卫·伍德的情况，或者如果符合其他人就将其丢弃。

00:27:42.610 --> 00:27:58.410
<v Ira Glass>And so, with all that in mind, let's just pick up with your show at this scene that happens in your second episode. Greg has just been to the courthouse to reexamine some of the physical evidence in the trial, the orange fibers. It is 50 days before David Wood's execution is scheduled to take place.
